{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1337674-shuankhsen-cults","id":1337674,"title":"Shuankhsen Cults","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mummy: The Curse"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-09-24T12:47:02-07:00","id":1337674,"title":"Shuankhsen Cults","content":"What do you imagine the inside of a shuankhsen cult looks like? At a minimum it would be a group deranged or desperate enough not to worry about potentially getting eaten in whole or part (you think arisen are cranky when you wake them). Some of them no doubt believe in sacrifice or ritualized cannabalism. Any further ideas?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-24T16:50:11-07:00","id":1337730,"title":"","content":"I see them viewing a sleeping Shaunkhsen as some sort of God and or Monster they have to feed to make the World go round. Like a Monster in a rural Town's well or Grendal or Huitzilipochtli.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-25T03:22:03-07:00","id":1337788,"title":"","content":"I sort of see it as them seeing it as a Pennywise like Thing, and try to sate it so it doesn\u2019t turn on them so it\u2019ll go back to sleep as soon as possible.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-28T17:57:12-07:00","id":1338360,"title":"","content":"I can certainly see the shuankhsen acting in much the same way as an Arisen, a thing the cult calls up to harm other people and keep them safe. As long as they have a target or a good supply of meat that shouldn\u2019t be a problem. Depending on the background they might even be sympathetic- say the descendants of runaway slaves the Shuankhsen took pity upon (or rescues from human traffickers in more recent history).<br /> <br /> The ones I find most intriguing are the ones who serve the Devourer directly. What kind of people would worship such a force of annihilation? A love craft cult? \u201cSure eat the world but save us for last OR kill us first and quickly so we don\u2019t suffer\u201d. Or something like a Mesoamerican cult- we feed you so you don\u2019t get so hungry you eat everything.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-30T13:02:32-07:00","id":1338678,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nothri</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1337674-shuankhsen-cults?p=1338360#post1338360\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can certainly see the shuankhsen acting in much the same way as an Arisen, a thing the cult calls up to harm other people and keep them safe. As long as they have a target or a good supply of meat that shouldn\u2019t be a problem. Depending on the background they might even be sympathetic- say the descendants of runaway slaves the Shuankhsen took pity upon (or rescues from human traffickers in more recent history).<br /> <br /> The ones I find most intriguing are the ones who serve the Devourer directly. What kind of people would worship such a force of annihilation? A love craft cult? \u201cSure eat the world but save us for last OR kill us first and quickly so we don\u2019t suffer\u201d. Or something like a Mesoamerican cult- we feed you so you don\u2019t get so hungry you eat everything.</div> </div> </div> </div>There might also be misanthropes who think the world is too full of pain to be worth its continued existence. The people life has hurt the most who were offered a path to hurt it back.<br /> <br /> The feed to avoid being eaten is more or less the Judge's position. Of course, they set up people to fail, to teach the way of rage and punish its unleashing, etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}